<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus Q1 sales rise 11.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus Q1 sales rise 11.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					2,951    vs   2,653</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    - subscriptions			     2,299    vs   2,198</p>
<p>    - advertising/sponsoring		    119    vs     117</p>
<p>    - other goods and services		  533    vs     338</p>
<p>NOTE - Canal Plus released the turnover figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
